      "review": "The pinned Blizzard ObjectiveTrackerModuleTemplate draws SetHeader on Header.Text with ObjectiveTrackerHeaderFont. LayoutContents calls AddObjective with the default line template, whose Text inherits ObjectiveTrackerLineFont. Blizzard_ObjectiveTrackerManager changes the tracker font sizes within the same per-locale font file mappings. ForeverCore v1.17.1 attaches the module without overriding these fonts. The block header is a client map name or numeric ID and the next node name comes from game data, so only the localized format is bound.",
